Capsule is free software, released under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 (see LICENSE).

It builds on the work of others:

mGBA  -  https://mgba.io  -  https://github.com/mgba-emu/mgba
  The Game Boy Advance emulation core. Copyright (c) Jeffrey Pfau and
  contributors. Mozilla Public License 2.0. mGBA is not copied into this
  repository: scripts/build_core.sh downloads a pinned revision at build time.

PokeDaisy  -  https://pokedaisy.com  -  https://github.com/lidor30/pokedaisy
  Core/pkcore/pk_profiles_gen.c (the per-game memory addresses) is generated
  from PokeDaisy's gamedata by tools/gen_profiles.py. GNU GPL v3.
  The idea of a live companion reading the game's memory comes from there too.

pret decompilation projects  -  https://github.com/pret
  The documentation of the Generation 3 data structures and save format that
  Core/pkcore implements.

